WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.816
This is a safe place.

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.056
What do you mean? Just
what your mum used to call it.

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.016
It's all over socials - that you killed her.

4
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.176
It's all your fault. and
it's being taken out on me.

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.856
What you gonna do?
Get your dad to kill me?

6
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.256
He'll probably get his dad to shag you.

7
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.576
Alana hasn't gone to her
grandparents to help them.

8
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.376
she's gone to get away from me.

9
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.696
Sarah's death is my fault.

10
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.976
The 24th. 25th and the 26th.

11
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.536
Can anyone explain where Michael was?

12
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.176
Alana? I don't know!

13
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.056
I saw Polly in a fight
with one of the boys.

14
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.296
"Fight". as in handbags.
like grabbing and shoving?

15
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.496
This wasn't just handbags. as you call it.

16
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.496
it was violent abuse.

17
00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.256
Craig. listen to me. do not
come here. I am at work.

18
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.656
Please. Is that him?

19
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:39.856
I'll go and speak to him now.

20
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.656
He just gets so bloody angry. Angry?

21
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.136
Do yourself a favour and go back...

22
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.616
Take your hands off me! Agh!

23
00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.400
Is that what you want?
Craig. please stop.

24
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.856
No-one's saying he did
it. that's not what I said.

25
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.256
but they're asking questions.

26
00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.296
What sort of questions? Past behaviour.

27
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.240
Rory said he saw him in some
kind of fight on the rugby pitch.

28
00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.736
I'm just telling you what I heard. Alana.

29
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:08.240
Let's get your stuff
and come stay with me.

30
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.640
Agh! Agh. agh!

31
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.296
Dad! Dad! Alana. wait!

32
00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.336
I haven't done anything!
Get him inside the house.

33
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.896
Get him inside the house. Agh!

34
00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.176
Dad. dad! It's all right. it's all right.

35
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.759
Calm down. Agh!

36
00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.640
Ridiculous!

37
00:01:38.759 --> 00:01:40.576
I have done nothing wrong!

38
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.816
Agh!

39
00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:45.336
You should be arresting him. not me.

40
00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.096
Charlie-X-ray-three-five-six.

41
00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.776
can I get an eta on that back-up. please?

42
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.896
What the hell was that?

43
00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.896
You had your hand
around his neck. Michael.

44
00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.240
People are gonna think you
were trying to strangle him.

45
00:02:30.079 --> 00:02:33.256
There are a few conflicting
accounts of what happened here.

46
00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.055
What's conflicting about them?

47
00:02:35.079 --> 00:02:37.976
Well. di stanhope says
that he came to see you.

48
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.816
Something about your
Tina Bradley review.

49
00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.336
I actually asked him not to come.

50
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.256
Andy... much. who's the
sergeant on duty at the house

51
00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:47.496
said it looked personal.

52
00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.856
Not something I'm
particularly comfortable about.

53
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.736
given your past relationship and
given you were meant to be working.

54
00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.816
That's exactly why I said...
And that Michael Polly

55
00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.096
came out of the house
and tried to assault him.

56
00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.296
That's not quite what happened.
He was forced to restrain Michael.

57
00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.176
Yes. There's also the fact

58
00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.216
that Michael Polly took
di stanhope by the neck.

59
00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.456
It was more fending him off.
Sorry. who was fending who off?

60
00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.176
Michael was fending
off Craig. di stanhope.

61
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.120
So. he didn't put his
hand around his neck?

62
00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.055
It's obviously relevant. Annie. Yes.

63
00:03:19.079 --> 00:03:21.576
Given how Sarah died.
It wasn't like that. Ivan.

64
00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:26.016
Michael Polly is our prime
suspect in the murder of his wife.

65
00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.496
We've spoken to di stanhope. and
he's decided not to press charges.

66
00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.656
but. Annie. if an incident such
as this occurs during your time

67
00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.696
as a family liaison officer.

68
00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.840
we need to remove you from that role.

69
00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.055
You're going to remove
me from the role?

70
00:03:42.079 --> 00:03:44.216
Why? What did I do?
It's standard practice.

71
00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:48.216
You need to step back. You've
compromised your position.

72
00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.256
I thought you didn't want to be flo?

73
00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.176
I didn't. but he's started talking.

74
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.296
Men like that find it hard
to talk at the best of times.

75
00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.656
but he's started opening up to me.

76
00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.096
Annie... You need me in there.

77
00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.936
I even recorded some
of it. conversations.

78
00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.640
Well. you shouldn't have...
I'll play them for you now.

79
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.416
I know he's not alibied.
but I don't think he's done it.

80
00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.656
not by the way he's talking.

81
00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.376
Let's come back to this later. No.
Let's come back to this now. ok?

82
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.680
I'm the only one he'll speak to.

83
00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.136
Why won't this bloody thing open now?

84
00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.096
Annie. we're not removing
you from the case.

85
00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.416
There are still actions to
be carried out from here.

86
00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.416
I don't want to work here.

87
00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:25.040
Annie. you will do as you're told.

88
00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.096
What? What was your ex doing there?

89
00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.520
Craig?

90
00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.159
Is that who sent you the flowers?

91
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.536
You said to scream at
you if you ever went back.

92
00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.440
Why didn't you tell me?

93
00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.200
Annie...

94
00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.760
They want me to stop as the
flo because of what happened.

95
00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.560
Just as he's started to talk.
they're taking it away from me.

96
00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.440
You have no choice.

97
00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.520
You need to tell the
police about the diary.

98
00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:44.576
Your mum was scared.
That's what she wrote.

99
00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.336
What if the victim wasn't your mum?

100
00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.576
And the man you were
suspicious of wasn't your dad?

101
00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.920
Would you go to the police then?

102
00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:56.096
So the only thing stopping
you from telling the police

103
00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.496
is the fact that it's your dad.

104
00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.096
That is a thing. Paul.

105
00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.776
Obviously. you love your dad.

106
00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.640
but not to the point of letting him
get away with hurting your mum.

107
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.680
Alana. at the very least.
let the police work it out.

108
00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.936
I don't know what it's about.

109
00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.720
She just said she wanted
to see us after school.

110
00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.135
Everyone's very excited about
the last game of the season.

111
00:06:32.159 --> 00:06:35.216
