the events of the past few weeks.

112
00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.456
Absolutely not.

113
00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.936
The things that must have
been happening at home.

114
00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.576
But we need to discuss
Dylan's academic work.

115
00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:46.256
In English and biology.
he's just about on course.

116
00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:50.416
but his history is... Well.
we're not where we need to be.

117
00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:54.096
We'd like Dylan to take a
test. to assess his progress

118
00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.536
