his grasp of the current module.

125
00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:17.016
Rugby is Dylan's best thing.
It's how he burns off energy.

126
00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.616
It's how he expresses
himself. Why would you do that?

127
00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.136
It's an incentive. No. it's just cruel.

128
00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.376
Mrs Sedgwick. if Dylan doesn't improve.

129
00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.056
he'll fall behind in terms
of his predicted grades.

130
00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.736
university choices.

131
00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.480
This is for him.

132
00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:35.776
I've spoken to mr
whitchurch. and he agrees.

133
00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.336
And mr Polly?

134
00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.480
Mr Polly is currently
suspended from the school.

135
00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.136
'Hello. you've
reached Alana Polly's phone.

136
00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.600
'Please leave a message.
and I'll get back to you.'

137
00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.616
Di stanhope doesn't
wish to press charges.

138
00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:41.976
The incident this morning. Michael.
outside. when you accosted him.

139
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.216
I accosted him?

140
00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.336
Is that how you're choosing
to remember it now. yeah?

141
00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.056
Either way. it's not so relevant now.

142
00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.576
as he doesn't want to press charges.

143
00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:52.016
You should also know ds
Cassidy will no longer be your flo.

144
00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.216
DC Hammond will remain in place.

145
00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.976
and we'll find someone to replace Annie.

146
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.016
Who? That's all to be worked out.

147
00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.656
And what if I don't want this person?

148
00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.216
If it's not Annie. I don't want anyone.

149
00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.576
In fact. I don't want anyone here.

150
00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.416
I'm still going to update you
whenever there's a development.

151
00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.200
You can show yourselves out.

152
00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.200
I just wanted to check on you.

153
00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.456
I'm worried I got a bit heavy.

154
00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.896
I just didn't like the way he
came charging out of that house.

155
00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.216
I told you not to come.
I said I couldn't talk.

156
00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:13.856
I know. Thanks to you. I'm no longer flo.

157
00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.960
I know. And nobody was
charging anywhere. Craig.

158
00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.096
Look. I'm sorry if I misread it.

159
00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.560
I just didn't want him to hurt
you. Could you listen. please?

160
00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:26.480
I don't want us to mess
this up. And we won't.

161
00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.200
Annie...

162
