Annie... I promise you.

163
00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.240
You've made promises before.

164
00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:46.600
Please.

165
00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:50.136
Please just let me book the table again

166
00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.760
