167
00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.456
Why don't you just come over.
and I'll burn you that lasagne.

168
00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.840
like I always used to?

169
00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.760
You'd do that for me? I'd do that for you.

170
00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:16.936
Alfie lamont strangled a
woman in Leigh woods. in 2008.

171
00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.696
He has a history of attacking
women. One of them was a jogger.

172
00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.496
Yeah. Annie... Hang
on. Let me just finish.

173
00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.816
Another was a Walker.
Sarah Polly was a Walker.

174
00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:28.136
And then he was released
from prison. 2021. and now...

175
00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.976
We've tried that... He
