183
00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.616
We've been working really
hard. I know how hard you work.

184
00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.496
That bag. by the way. Ivan
says it's in the evidence room.

185
00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.616
Bag? Bag of evidence.

186
00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.016
