187
00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.816
Stuff found at the outer
cordon of the murder site.

188
00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.176
Ivan's asked if you could check it.

189
00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.656
Just. you know. if you have time.

190
00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.256
Hello? Yeah. what is it? I'm at work.

191
00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.280
Look. it'll have to wait until I come home.

192
00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.816
