199
00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.136
Shoes.

200
00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.936
Well. they're not wrong.
You do need to improve.

201
00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.376
But who plays in that match. that's...

202
00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.016
That's still my decision.

203
00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.400
They said you were no
longer at the school. sir.

204
00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:32.536
So. what's it about. this
essay? The Munich Agreement.

205
00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:35.016
Mr bowman says he wants
an essay on Chamberlain.

206
