essay just relaying what happened.

210
00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.536
What they want is to
find out what you think.

211
00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:48.096
They want an argument. An argument?

212
00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.536
Yes. pick a line. just like in rugby.

213
00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.616
Pick an angle. and the harder the angle.

214
00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.416
the more impressive it is.

215
00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.456
So. how about this -

216
00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.536
how about that he
was right to trust Hitler?

217
00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.416
Was he? Well. that doesn't matter.

218
00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.136
That's what you claim.

219
00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.696
What I'm trying to... Well.
what mr bowman is trying to do

220
00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.936
