us see history differently.

221
00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.000
In a new way. to see it in your way.

222
00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.496
But that's not what I'm doing
here. and you need to leave.

223
00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.640
Please. sir.

224
00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.240
'Our focus stays on one man.'

225
00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:27.056
where was Michael
Polly in the three days

226
00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.816
