No. footage is patchy
because it's such a rural area.

235
00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.256
All done?

236
00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.216
What's he...? What's he
want me to do with these?

237
00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:12.360
Just logged and bagged up properly
and taken down the evidence store.

238
00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.736
Hello. 'Have you seen it?'

239
00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.656
